WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:30.037
"What a wonderful banquet!" said the queen.

2
00:00:30.038 --> 00:00:32.866
The king looked very proud.

3
00:00:32.867 --> 00:00:44.237
"Wait till the guests see the new jester!" he said.

4
00:00:44.238 --> 00:00:51.572
Dirk pushed Tink into the room.

5
00:00:51.573 --> 00:00:54.680
Tink put a ball on his hat and bowed.

6
00:00:54.681 --> 00:00:57.137
The ball fell off.

7
00:00:57.138 --> 00:01:01.127
No one laughed.

8
00:01:01.128 --> 00:01:03.230
The king frowned.

9
00:01:03.231 --> 00:01:08.320
"Pull a rabbit from that hat!" said the king.

10
00:01:08.321 --> 00:01:12.968
"Or go to the Grim Dungeon!" snapped Dirk.

11
00:01:12.969 --> 00:01:15.732
Tink looked scared.

12
00:01:15.733 --> 00:01:18.741
"Poor Tink," thought Tom.

13
00:01:18.742 --> 00:01:21.260
"Umm," said Tink.

14
00:01:21.261 --> 00:01:28.816
"I don't know . . ."

15
00:01:28.817 --> 00:01:30.749
He took off his hat.

16
00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:34.384
Tom quickly waved his wand.

17
00:01:34.385 --> 00:01:39.699
Poof! A rabbit appeared.

18
00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:44.099
The guests cheered.

19
00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:51.400
"Bravo!" cried the king.

20
00:01:51.401 --> 00:01:55.815
"Next I'll spin a pie on a stick," Tink said.

21
00:01:55.816 --> 00:01:58.989
Tink looked at Tom.

22
00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:02.969
Nervously Tink spun the pie on the stick.

23
00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:05.598
The pie wobbled.

24
00:02:05.599 --> 00:02:07.911
"Uh-oh!" Tom said.

25
00:02:07.912 --> 00:02:10.543
He waved his wand.

26
00:02:10.544 --> 00:02:25.304
"Pie, stay! Don't fly away!"

27
00:02:25.305 --> 00:02:28.036
The pie flew through the air!

28
00:02:28.037 --> 00:02:37.263
Splat! It hit the king.

29
00:02:37.264 --> 00:02:42.222
The queen laughed.

30
00:02:42.223 --> 00:02:46.747
The guests laughed too.

31
00:02:46.748 --> 00:02:52.483
"That jester is funny!" some guests cried.

32
00:02:52.484 --> 00:02:54.863
But the king was angry.

33
00:02:54.864 --> 00:02:59.675
Everybody was laughing at him!

34
00:02:59.676 --> 00:03:07.046
"Off to the Grim Dungeon!" yelled the king.

35
00:03:07.047 --> 00:03:14.575
Dirk dragged Tink away.

36
00:03:14.576 --> 00:03:18.212
"It's my fault!" Tom said to Cat.

37
00:03:18.213 --> 00:03:23.857
"I have to help Tink!"
